            "@type": "dcat:Dataset",
            "dct:description": {
                "@language": "eng",
                "@value": "This dataset includes an identification number that groups together persons sharing the same dwelling. It also provides variables on household income. The variables in this dataset are only available once a year, in December.\nThis dataset is part of those provided by the IGSS within the framework of the Luxembourg Microdata Platform on Labour and Social Protection. All datasets offered by the IGSS are designed to be interoperable through the use of common pseudonymized identifiers, enabling the linkage of information across different datasets.\nAll the variables in this dataset are personal data and are subject to GDPR compliant protection measures. \nScope: all people living in Luxembourg (affiliated or not to the Luxembourg social security). \nDelay for providing the most recent data: current month -3. \nData source : CCSS, RNPP (calculation : IGSS)."
            }
        },
